WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.913
(rap music)

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.550
- [Interviewer] Gabrielle,
where'd you grow up?

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:07.820
