or something like that.

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.383
So he got three life sentences.

00:01:16.383 --> 00:01:18.170
- [Interviewer] What about Mom?

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:22.840
- Mom kept gettin' busted
with cocaine and prostitution,

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:25.320
