00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:29.956
- [Interviewer] So, after
you left your grandparents...

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:33.111
- I got kicked out at 15
'cause I got pregnant.

00:01:33.111 --> 00:01:33.944
- [Interviewer] Wow.

00:01:33.944 --> 00:01:36.368
- And I had the baby

00:01:36.368 --> 00:01:39.370
and I thought the man was in love with me,

00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:41.323
but he's 70 years old so,

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:44.028
course, he didn't show up to the hospital.

00:01:44.028 --> 00:01:44.890
- [Interviewer] How old was he?

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:46.600
- He was 70, I'm 15.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:48.265
- [Interviewer] He was 70?

00:01:48.265 --> 00:01:49.098
(Gabrielle murmurs in agreement)

00:01:49.098 --> 00:01:49.931
- [Interviewer] And you were 15?

00:01:49.931 --> 00:01:51.070
(Gabrielle murmurs in agreement)

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:52.840
- I thought that, you know,
we were gonna make it work

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.487
but that was a lie.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.550
I have seven now.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.737
I have seven kids now.

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:00.813
- [Interviewer] Wow.

00:02:00.813 --> 00:02:02.780
