00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:23.400
Most of my mind, too

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:27.310
'cause I really don't know
what I really missed with that.

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:29.110
I'm with them 24/7.

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:30.900
But I believe him.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.830
She my daughter, so

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.120
