00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.550
- [Interviewer] So
where are your kids now?

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:37.383
- They're in Texas.

00:02:37.383 --> 00:02:38.441
They're all in the system.

00:02:38.441 --> 00:02:39.274
- [Interviewer] They're in the system?

00:02:39.274 --> 00:02:40.107
- Yeah.

00:02:40.107 --> 00:02:41.147
- [Interviewer] And how old are you?

00:02:41.147 --> 00:02:41.980
